      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Transporting a two-wheeler across India via Mauganj requires meticulous documentation to ensure a seamless, secure, and legally compliant journey. Whether you are relocating for work, education, or a new home, the success of your bike transportation depends heavily on the accuracy and completeness of the paperwork submitted to your logistics partner.</p>
<p>Skipping even a single document can lead to significant delays, additional charges, or outright refusal of service at the dispatch or delivery centers. To avoid these disruptions, it is crucial to have the following essential documents ready and verified before handing over your vehicle.</p>

<h3>Essential Documents for Two-Wheeler Transit</h3>
<p>When engaging a professional bike transporter, you must provide a specific set of documents that verify ownership, legal status, and insurance coverage. These documents form the legal backbone of the transportation contract and protect both the shipper and the carrier.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self-Attested RC Photocopy:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Registration Certificate (RC) is the primary proof of ownership. You must submit a clear, legible photocopy of the current RC. It is mandatory that this copy is self-attested, meaning you must sign the duplicate yourself.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>The details on the copy must match the physical vehicle, including the chassis number and engine number, to prevent any identity mismatches during transit verification</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current PUC Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate confirms that your bike meets environmental safety standards. While primarily a legal requirement for road use, many logistics providers in Mauganj request this to ensure the vehicle is in a roadworthy condition.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>An expired PUC can raise red flags regarding the vehicle's maintenance status, potentially complicating the loading process</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Your bike must carry a valid third-party insurance policy. This document protects you against liability in the event of an accident involving third parties during the transit period. Ensure the policy is active and covers the entire duration of the journey, from the point of pickup in Mauganj to the final destination.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA-Approved Consignment Bilty:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The consignment bilty is the most critical document in the logistics chain. It serves as the legal contract between you and the transporter, detailing the goods, weight, and route. It must be IBA (Indian Banks' Association) approved to ensure it is recognized for any potential financial or legal disputes.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>This document tracks the movement of your bike and is required for customs clearance if applicable</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
</div>

<h3>The Importance of Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
<p>Beyond standard third-party coverage, we strongly recommend opting for <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>. Standard insurance often excludes damage caused by transit mishaps, such as scratches, dents, or internal mechanical damage. Marine transit insurance specifically covers the vehicle against all risks associated with land transport.</p>
<p>By declaring the full market value of your bike, you ensure that in the unlikely event of damage, you receive compensation equal to the vehicle's current worth. This comprehensive coverage provides total peace of mind, guaranteeing that your asset is fully protected from door to door.</p></div>
